composed of two couples, one at the entrance of a building and another on a 
beach suggested by rocks and an oared ship [20260728193104846163_af20f67f; 
20260728193024907165_c795e3ef]. It further notes costume and armament (women in
long pleated skirts; men in Minoan zoma with swords and spears at their waists)
[20260728193104924512_ce5a9d9a; 20260728193024985659_26135e63], and highlights 
very fine gestural details indicating the intimacy of the left-hand couple that
