opinions and conflicting findings in a disinterested tone. Do not editorialize.
When editorial bias towards one particular point of view can be detected the 
article needs to be fixed. The only bias that should be evident is the bias 
attributed to the source.
6. Indicate the relative prominence of opposing views. Ensure that the 
reporting of different views on a subject adequately reflects the relative 
